0001   0000             ; An INCLUDE is listed before the file it pulls in, so the listing reads in
0002   0000             ; the order the source is read, and the included lines carry a depth marker in
0003   0000             ; column 11. The marker is 1-based: the file named on the command line is
0004   0000             ; depth 1 and unmarked, its includes are depth 2 and marked `+`.
0005   0000                     .org  0
0006   0000 01                  nop
